Upstream-Name: tapedeck
Upstream-Contact: Ashwin Balaji <s.ashwinbalaji.de@gmail.com>
Source: https://codeberg.org/abksh/tapedeck
Comment:
 The source tarball also carries every Rust crate the build uses under
 vendor/, each with its own licence file, and a prebuilt copy of the web UI
 under static/. The crates are almost all MIT, Apache-2.0 or both; the
 generated RPM spec's License tag lists every licence among them.

